          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# Comparative Analysis\n\nUse this to compare choreography and orchestration under the same suite window. Read left-to-right: throughput advantage, latency advantage, correctness, then service-side corroboration."
